      "text": "PAGASA HEAVY RAINFALL WARNING\n#VerbenaPH and Shear Line\n2PM, November 25, 2025 Tuesday\n\n🔴 RED LEVEL\nPalawan\nAklan\nAntique\nwestern Capiz\nwestern Iloilo\nsouthwestern Negros Occidental\n\n🟠 ORANGE LEVEL\nsoutheastern Isabela\nnorthern Aurora\nOccidental Mindoro\nrest of Capiz\nrest of Iloilo\nGuimaras\nrest of Negros Occidental\n\n🟡 YELLOW LEVEL\nMetro Manila\ncentral Isabela\neastern Quirino\nrest of Aurora\nBulacan\nRizal\nQuezon\nLaguna\ncentral and eastern Batangas\nsouthwestern Negros Oriental\n\n⚠️ Serious flooding and landslides may be expected in these areas.\n\nNext update at 5PM. | via @arielrojasPH",
